@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "配置中" as Configuring
state "已激活" as Active
[*] --> Configuring : gf_frame_create
Configuring : 拥有 Runtime
Configuring : load / add_capability
Configuring : validate / initialize_restart
Configuring --> Configuring : 激活失败\n（状态保留）
Configuring --> Active : gf_frame_activate\n（Runtime 仅移交一次）
Active : 拥有 ScanDriver
Active : gf_frame_scan
Active : load / add / activate 被拒绝
Active --> Active : 扫描失败\n（保留上次结果和 VM 状态）
Configuring --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
Active --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
@enduml
